    "body": "### Contributing guidelines\n\n- [x] I have read [CONTRIBUTING.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CONTRIBUTING.md)\n- [x] I have read [CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/main/CODE_OF_CONDUCT.md)\n\n### Module(s)\n\nmini.snippets\n\n### Description\n\nI was not getting any snippets on JSX files using the `from_lang` generator.\n\nI can create a PR that adds a `from_vscode_extension_manifest` generator. It would improve compatibility with plugins like \"rafamadriz/friendly-snippets\".",
